{"step_index":596,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T09:04:44Z","input_tokens":2324,"cache_read_tokens":257718,"output_tokens":810,"content":"### 🚀 Grok Bot Dual Hybrid Dashboard Live\n\n- **Live URL**: [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)\n- **Workspace**: [`~/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard`](file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard)\n- **Approved Decision**: [`~/.gemini/decisions/approved/2026-10-19-trading-bot-architecture.md`](file:///Users/dev/.gemini/decisions/approved/2026-10-19-trading-bot-architecture.md)\n\n---\n\n### Key Features Built\n\n1. **Grok Bot Cyber UI (1:1 Video 1 Replica)**:\n   - Deep space palette (`#070913`, blue-indigo glass cards, glowing badges).\n   - Dynamic **stepped canvas chart** tracking the scale from \\$42.00 up to \\$5,739.00 with vertical dashed handover flags when traders are fired.\n   - **Now Copying Card** with active trader details, copy ratio (`0.25x`), and last 6 win/loss indicator pills.\n   - **Automated Fire Rule**: Tracks consecutive losses and automatically executes `2 L in a row -> fired`, rotating the next trader from the weekly top bench (`@kai_blitz` $\\to$ `@sol_dumpling` $\\to$ `@0xnora`).\n   - **Live Monospace Copy Feed**: Real-time terminal log stream with token badges (`$SNEK`, `$ZOOM`, `$FLUFF`, `$MOCHA`, `$BLAST`), `[COPY]`, `[EXIT]`, and P&L tags.\n   - **Who We Copy Bench**: 6 interactive trader cards with status badges (`FOLLOWING`, `FIRED`, `BENCH`).\n\n2. **Quant Regime Mode (Leaked Prompt Integration)**:\n   - Toggle switch in header switches the dashboard into the **Quant Engine**.\n   - **Two-Layer Architecture**: Displays Brain (asynchronous regime & invalidation derivation) vs Reflex (sub-100ms live candle gating).\n   - **Deterministic State Engine**: Live Order Book Imbalance (OBI gauge), Mid-price, Bid-Ask Spread, and Realized Volatility.\n   - **Hard Risk Gates**: Hardcoded 15% drawdown circuit breaker (auto-halts on breach) and quarter-Kelly position sizing ($0.25x$).\n\n3. **Interactive Controls**:\n   - Play/Pause toggle.\n   - Speed multipliers: `1x`, `2x`, `5x`, `10x`.\n   - Manual Fire button to test handover rules on demand.\n   - One-click Reset button.\n\n---\n\n```\n[Agent Status: COMPLETED]\nSquad handoff complete: Blueprint (Arch) → Forge (Engine) → Pixel (UI) → Shield (AppSec)\nHUD status updated to completed. Auto-closing.\n```"}
