{"step_index":614,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T11:11:25Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. now im really curious to make one like that with a same kind of ui. can we do that?\n2. whats the progress now?\n3. can we pause the installation? \n4. i got a leaked prompt tiktok for this project as well. wanna see it?\n5. YOU PASTE IT INTO CLAUDE CODE AND IT SETS UP THE BOT WHILE YOU GRAB A COFFEE \n\nNo programming required. Just paste. A single prompt does it all:\n\nTime required: 1 minute\nActions: copy and paste into Claude Code\n\nThe mistake that wipes out the accounts of 99% of traders with bots: they use the same strategy for everything. But the market isn't the same on a quiet Tuesday as it is in the middle of a crash\n\n→ Read the market like a quant: detect if it's calm, sideways, jittery, or in freefall, and switch strategies for each one\n\n→ Handbrake: maximum drawdown of 15% and a kill switch that's checked before EVERY order\n\n→ Test before touching the money: backtest the strategy period by period with real data and refuse to trade if it doesn't beat the market\n\n→ Night shift: while you sleep, it analyzes what went wrong and leaves ready improvements. You decide if they're applied\n\n→ Zero code: you paste, fill in your data, and Claude handles the rest\n\nBefore, this meant a team of PhDs, thousands of lines of code, and weeks of work. \n6. now in agency mode, with all the knowledge now you have about these trading bots, lets implement this\n7. what would you suggest?\n8. do it\n9. so now what i should do?\n10. lets deploy it first\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**: \"lets deploy it first\" — Deploy the newly built **Grok Bot Dual Hybrid Dashboard** to production following the user's mandatory **4-Stage Website Development Lifecycle**.\n- **Scope & Success Criteria**: Complet\n<truncated 4081 bytes>\nAntigravity/grok-bot-dashboard` and verify clean secret scan.\n3. **Stage 4 (Deploy)**:\n   - Run `bun run build` to package latest assets into `dist/`.\n   - Deploy to Cloudflare Pages via `wrangler pages deploy dist --project-name grok-bot-dashboard`.\n   - Smoke test the production live URL and present it to the user.\n4. **Lifecycle Auto-Close**: Update companion HUD (`set_agent_status.py Shield completed \"Deployed to Cloudflare Pages\"`).\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Mandatory Lifecycle**: Must strictly execute Stage 2 (SEO) $\\to$ Stage 3 (Security / `vibe-audit`) $\\to$ Stage 4 (Deployment).\n- **Communication Style**: Caveman/Ponytail (terse, dense technical shorthand, code-first).\n- **Security Sandboxing**: Zero private keys or real exchange trading credentials; preserve deterministic simulation boundaries.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 1 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1792399183377_cd5dbcd4]\nPath: file:///Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fbbefb03-c012-4cd6-882c-39f6295a6918/.user_uploaded/media_1792399183377_cd5dbcd4.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-19T08:39:49Z\n\n# Running Background Tasks\nThe following background tasks were running at the time this checkpoint was created.\nUse the manage_task tool to interact with them (e.g. to kill them or check their status).\n\n{\n  \"taskId\": \"fbbefb03-c012-4cd6-882c-39f6295a6918/task-582\",\n  \"toolName\": \"run_command\",\n  \"toolSummary\": \"Run dev server on port 5173\",\n  \"description\": \"bun run dev --port 5173\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-10-19T09:03:37.477753Z\",\n  \"stepIndex\": 582,\n  \"logUri\": \"file:///Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fbbefb03-c012-4cd6-882c-39f6295a6918/.system_generated/tasks/task-582.log\",\n 